Preserved development failure (before the final test runs).

Command:
  python src/wp84_r400_physical_endpoint_averaging.py --write-json

Result:
  exit code 1; the initial JSON producer passed fractions.Fraction values to
  json.dumps without a serializer. The exception was:

  TypeError: Object of type Fraction is not JSON serializable

Correction:
  The ledger producer now serializes exact Fraction values as rational
  strings via default=str. The rational in-memory checker and tests continue
  to use Fraction objects. This was a serialization defect, not an analytic
  or source-semantic result.
